Ah, thank you yes that worked! I see now from your answer that the cause of the problem was that R v4.0.0 changed the default for stringsAsFactors to FALSE, so an alternative that also works is adding stringsAsFactors = TRUE when making the dataframe

Thanks very much for the help!

Rowena

